  "notice": "A starting point, not certified for the country. Check each column against the instrument before you rely on it. Abu Dhabi only: the columns are the data DOH's Standard s. 3.6 lists, in its order; the pages of the books PH 17 and PH 20 were not seen, so print into them following the book's own page and line numbers. The patient identifier of s. 7.2.1 is not printed yet. PH 18, the wards' book, is not a pharmacy's. Narcotic prescriptions go through the unified platform (s. 3.9); this set does not talk to it. Dubai's register book is not in this set.",
